ave","turn_index":22},{"dia_id":"D24:23","global_turn_index":424,"locator":"[S24T23]","raw_turn_sha256":"0ecd9533eff1f25190bccf952bb1406ebe69fff641a45350825cce3863766c58","rendered_turn_sha256":"dc5d8a22ddef1752d1648f3d79ddefeb31d5b7a5d363282c500846cab1f80ec9","session_date":"2023-10-19","session_datetime":"2023-10-19T10:11:00","session_id":"session_24","session_index":24,"source_sha256":"ceb6992278d8c2721261cd39b4c1c08091de20f7b8ce7a6f788b390e272d7537","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":23}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: Yes, Dave! That was an incredible experience to visit similar streets like you shared in your photo. Is there anything else that interests you in Tokyo?\n[S24T13] (dia_id: D24:13)\n\nDave: Of course, Calvin! Tokyo is amazing! I want to know everything about it - the people, the culture, the food, take a walk at the vibrant city life! In the photo below, the city is so alive and colorful that's impressive! It will be an unforgettable experience!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowded street at night with people walking and walking]\n[S24T14] (dia_id: D24:14)\n\nCalvin: That photo's a great pic! The lights, the people - so lively! Can't wait to hear your emotions when you see that in person!\n[S24T15] (dia_id: D24:15)\n\nDave: It's really amazing. Hope I'll get to see it in person soon!\n[S24T16] (dia_id: D24:16)\n\nCalvin: Cool, Dave! I'm actually going to Tokyo next month after the tour ends. Sometimes I wish I could go back to places like the one in the photo below. What a great view!\n[Image caption: a photo of a city at night with a tall building in the background]\n[S24T17] (dia_id: D24:17)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! That's great to hear! Any specific spots in Tokyo that you're really excited to check out?\n[S24T18] (dia_id: D24:18)\n\nCalvin: Yeah definitely! Shibuya Crossing is like Tokyo's Times Square, and I was excited to explore Shinjuku. Plus, there's amazing food there, can't wait to try it again! Look at the photo of Shibuya Crossing at night, that's amazing!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people with umbrellas in the rain]\n[S24T19] (dia_id: D24:19)\n\nDave: Shibuya and Shinjuku are cool spots! The food in Tokyo is great, I'll have so much fun exploring all the different places. Have you tried ramen yet? Here's a photo of a ramen bowl that I tried in Boston, it was delicious, but i think in Tokyo it will be even better!\n[Image caption: a photo of a bowl of soup with broccoli and noodles]\n[S24T20] (dia_id: D24:20)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Never tried it, but it's supposed to be awesome. Gonna give it a shot while in Tokyo!\n[S24T21] (dia_id: D24:21)\n\nDave: Do it, Calvin! Once you try it, you'll never go back. Bon voyage and have fun!\n[S24T22] (dia_id: D24:22)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I'll definitely give it a shot. Appreciate the encouragement! See you soon, bye!\n[S24T23] (dia_id: D24:23)","text_sha256":"8898082b633557f8e5f0c1c9153e30e60773dcd2a2a0a06c05f7097d0a1352a8","timestamp":"2023-10-19T10:11:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":771,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":14622,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":15393},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_